This is just a short message. I just made my very first ascension, a
wizard named Wallace 80.

I had decided a couple of weeks ago to play a wizard-mode wizard to get
some experience in some of the spells and techniques. I was only going
to cheat when necessary. Well, I got to the vibrating square without
ever deliberately cheating. I realize now that I was able to teleport
in a few places where I normally couldn't. Anyway, I left him there and
tried regular play again.

A few games later I got to Wallace 80. I was issued a spellbook of
create monster. This and a magic marker will get you any spellbook and
scroll you want.

I always dip into the first level of the mines for the experience.
There is hardly ever anything there to hurt even a tourist, and it's
worth two or three experience levels. Well, this time there was a wand
of wishing. Hmm. I got SDSM, GoPower, and BoSpeed. And a magic marker.

To the bottom for the luckstone and some gems. It was the wine cellar,
and booze looked smoky, but a pyrolisk got most of them on the way back
up.

Anyway, that was most of my good luck, and it was enough. I sacrificed
and prayed until I got finger of death, and the quest was a cinch. Then
with the Eye, nothing ever bothered me until I reached the Astral
Plane. I died once, but at the second temple I found my altar.

The wand of wishing helped, but a few games before I lost a wizard when
I got really careless in Fort Ludios. I guess I'm finally learning to
play these guys.

